data: {"id": "856c1c6358e745b6-thinking-parallel_evidence-1779", "run_id": "856c1c6358e745b6", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据已采集的证据，对 `aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn` 的分析如下：\n\n### 1. 实体身份与生命周期确认\n- **Pod**: `workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn` (UID: `bffd1771-cb0a-4bea-96ed-0a46e5b3a923`)。\n- **当前状态**: `CrashLoopBackOff`，Restart 次数 12+ 次。\n- **Owner**: `ReplicaSet/workload-dff5cbc6b`。\n- **Phase**: `Running` (Pod 生命周期未终止，但容器状态异常)。\n\n### 2. 事实支持分析\n- **异常确认**: `kubectl describe` 和 `events` 明确显示 `Reason: CrashLoopBackOff`，且在过去 39 分钟内发生了 153 次 Back-off 重启警告。\n- **根因线索 (CrashLoopBackOffRuntime)**: \n    - 容器启动后执行 `python3 /opt/aio", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788794142528, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

